      "blockId": "paragraph:overview:0012",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "To learn more about using goals and agents, see [`Agents, Goals, and Behaviors`](https://developer.apple.comhttps://developer.apple.com/library/archive/documentation/General/Conceptual/GameplayKit_Guide/Agent.html#//apple_ref/doc/uid/TP40015172-CH8) in [`GameplayKit Programming Guide`](https://developer.apple.comhttps://developer.apple.com/library/archive/documentation/General/Conceptual/GameplayKit_Guide/index.html#//apple_ref/doc/uid/TP40015172).",
      "normalizedSource": "To learn more about using goals and agents, see [`Agents, Goals, and Behaviors`](https://developer.apple.comhttps://developer.apple.com/library/archive/documentation/General/Conceptual/GameplayKit_Guide/Agent.html#//apple_ref/doc/uid/TP40015172-CH8) in [`GameplayKit Programming Guide`](https://developer.apple.comhttps://developer.apple.com/library/archive/documentation/General/Conceptual/GameplayKit_Guide/index.html#//apple_ref/doc/uid/TP40015172).",
